VALUES ('nestjs-modular-monolith', 'NestJS Modular Monolith: Modules, Dependency Injection & Clean Boundaries', 'Build a backend that one team can keep changing for years: modules split by domain, providers wired by dependency injection, validated request DTOs, thin controllers, domain rules in services and module boundaries without circular dependencies, each checked by tests.', 'An intermediate course for developers who can write an HTTP API and want its structure to survive the next ten features. Every lesson starts from an incident on the CodeDev learning platform''s API - a learner enrolled twice in the same course, progress that went from 80% back to 40%, a request that wrote an isAdmin field into the database, a deploy that failed with "Nest can''t resolve dependencies" because two modules needed each other - and fixes it with a boundary you can test: modules by domain, providers and constructor injection, exports and imports, DTO validation with a whitelist, thin controllers, domain errors mapped to HTTP, enrollment and progress rules, repositories, breaking a circular dependency and testing modules with fakes. 12 lessons with True/False quizzes on real code and evidence, and TypeScript challenges graded by hidden tests.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dex6q1cqh/image/upload/c_limit,w_1600/f_auto,q_auto/v1793017314/codedev/courses/nestjs-modular-monolith/cover', 'intermediate'::level_enum, 360, 'CodeDev Engineering Team', 0, 0, 100,
